              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "raser — \"to shave (often se raser); to raze\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Le coiffeur lui a rasé la barbe. The barber shaved off his beard."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Se raser — to shave; informal ça me rase — that bores me."
            }
          ]
